			"notes": "Tim 1.2 (Trail Investigator Module) is a comprehensive multi-version Meteor Client utility and base-hunting addon fully compatible across Minecraft 1.21.4 to 1.21.11. + 26.1.\n\n- Baromine\nAutomates Baritone mining of selected ores or blocks until the target is reached. Includes safety limits, combat and hazard handling, auto-crafting, Ender Chest deposits, tool mending, notifications, and optional logout/reconnect.\n\n- Threaturn\nThreaturn ignores calm neutral mobs and counts those showing aggression. Some provoked mobs may be missed because Minecraft doesn’t send all aggression states to clients."
		},
